    {
      "id": "s03",
      "title": "The complete question",
      "mode": "setup",
      "tempo": "brisk",
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": "conditions",
          "text": "Both trials use a smooth horizontal surface. External horizontal force is negligible during impact. Take right as positive.",
          "start": 0.55,
          "speechEnd": 9.89,
          "end": 9.89,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "32a1620b2a9a00e54c6d247d0651e663a589ea4f02d76793b3779f7cb50cd952",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.0,
          "providerTrimEnd": 9.34
        },
        {
          "id": "mass-a",
          "text": "Particle A has mass two kilograms",
          "start": 10.04,
          "speechEnd": 12.54,
          "end": 12.54,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "cb8726a88bb0cebf1b2fc3a0b4048de3e7dc3861ac6fc98427be69274c42c40e",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.04,
          "providerTrimEnd": 2.54,
          "figures": [
            {
              "phrase": "two",
              "target": "A.mass",
              "value": "2"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "before-a",
          "text": "and moves right at four metres per second.",
          "start": 12.69,
          "speechEnd": 14.92,
          "end": 14.92,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "4966967be65e1cf837b35a14f559b8c327c78d27c671a2e00de6311f96bc71d1",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.0,
          "providerTrimEnd": 2.23,
          "figures": [
            {
              "phrase": "four",
              "target": "A.before",
              "value": "4"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "mass-b",
          "text": "Particle B has mass three kilograms",
          "start": 15.07,
          "speechEnd": 17.33,
          "end": 17.33,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "f6c200c8df7e751e865153711dc4f9e75e381c6731c31bd8ca7e904ae193303e",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.03,
          "providerTrimEnd": 2.29,
          "figures": [
            {
              "phrase": "three",
              "target": "B.mass",
              "value": "3"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "before-b",
          "text": "and moves left at one metre per second.",
          "start": 17.48,
          "speechEnd": 19.55,
          "end": 19.55,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "cb1e855c77cc21a701e121a77285ee6a0854c3f8706ed58e73056f837ae1711b",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.01,
          "providerTrimEnd": 2.08,
          "figures": [
            {
              "phrase": "one",
              "target": "B.before",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "after-a",
          "text": "In trial one, A rebounds left at two metres per second. Find B's final speed and direction.",
          "start": 19.7,
          "speechEnd": 26.8,
          "end": 26.8,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "7afb3b9b8e2c809ce90b264b35df5ccce0827be471d7998c9ea0735981b0037e",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.0,
          "providerTrimEnd": 7.1,
          "figures": [
            {
              "phrase": "two",
              "target": "A.after",
              "value": "2"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "together",
          "text": "In the separate sticking trial, find the common velocity. Both questions use the original before diagram. Take a moment to read them.",
          "hold": 2.0,
          "start": 26.95,
          "speechEnd": 38.0,
          "end": 40.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "4a620cfa617ded26b0c54cd2febdb0aa05ef61b922f1829f6a288f5954045eb5",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.01,
          "providerTrimEnd": 11.06
        }
      ],
      "audio": "direct-collisions-s03.mp3",
      "duration": 40.594286,
      "sampleDuration": 40.55,
      "holds": [
        {
          "start": 38.0,
          "end": 40.0,
          "kind": "result",
          "duration": 2.0
        }
      ],
      "audioSha256": "fadb3d1b11ecb228df4c8ddabc108c5b6a3dbc54065f47c0a2a57531d79933e9",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "voiceId": "gYWKdgLtqjPO3D5uDrDP",
      "voiceSpeed": 1.0,
      "modelId": "eleven_turbo_v2_5",
      "sampleRate": 44100
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "title": "Why we conserve the pair's momentum",
      "mode": "system",
      "tempo": "brisk",
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": "system",
          "text": "Our system is A and B. Weight balances normal reaction; external horizontal force is negligible during impact.",
          "start": 0.55,
          "speechEnd": 10.22,
          "end": 10.22,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "530cbc25a3585e4032746c4af5590ddc4a9ce6066675883d3d2688fd51370129",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.0,
          "providerTrimEnd": 9.67,
          "caption": "System: A and B together"
        },
        {
          "id": "internal",
          "text": "Equal and opposite contact forces are internal. They change the individual momenta in opposite ways.",
          "start": 10.37,
          "speechEnd": 16.86,
          "end": 16.86,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "7ec1ac523dd2cd34ce3a3859d65935b6facee421bae9b71440f5a614f0b6f39c",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.0,
          "providerTrimEnd": 6.49,
          "caption": "Equal and opposite internal forces"
        },
        {
          "id": "conserve",
          "text": "The changes cancel for the pair, so total momentum before equals total momentum after.",
          "start": 17.01,
          "speechEnd": 23.1,
          "end": 23.1,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "92eb32e5023fcfb431d57a21c561cd311a141e5a3b444c3f20e26b4af64eb8b7",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.05,
          "providerTrimEnd": 6.14,
          "caption": "Total momentum stays the same"
        },
        {
          "id": "signs",
          "text": "Use signed velocities: right positive, left negative. The minus sign describes direction, not mass.",
          "start": 23.25,
          "speechEnd": 32.33,
          "end": 32.33,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "a15d0cd212274d1ddb801590fbd13b7e46c0bef04b6a1850c7cb8939e7612791",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.0,
          "providerTrimEnd": 9.08,
          "caption": "Right positive; left negative"
        }
      ],
      "audio": "direct-collisions-s04.mp3",
      "duration": 32.914286,
      "sampleDuration": 32.88,
      "holds": [],
      "audioSha256": "2475b56424bf00d6f41cb9a1de758fb91f447055f3744d310b9716213dfcd9f4",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "voiceId": "gYWKdgLtqjPO3D5uDrDP",
      "voiceSpeed": 1.0,
      "modelId": "eleven_turbo_v2_5",
      "sampleRate": 44100
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "title": "Trial 1: find B's velocity",
      "mode": "separate",
      "tempo": "slow",
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": "goal",
          "text": "Find B's final velocity. Keep both diagrams beside the working.",
          "start": 0.55,
          "speechEnd": 6.14,
          "end": 6.14,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "bcacbb54b1950ad21dc8070d17c2015cebf3475548c3a8424150e5a6c82db411",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.0,
          "providerTrimEnd": 5.59
        },
        {
          "id": "principle",
          "text": "With negligible external horizontal force, momentum before equals momentum after.",
          "start": 6.29,
          "speechEnd": 13.76,
          "end": 13.76,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "03d4c3b62faf5e50d8513ba019fc7845744d84e1bd2cc3149205eaed1f16bc12",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.03,
          "providerTrimEnd": 7.5,
          "cuePhrase": "momentum before",
          "ink": "momentum before = momentum after"
        },
        {
          "id": "formula",
          "text": "Mass A times u A, plus mass B times u B, equals mass A times v A, plus mass B times v B.",
          "start": 13.91,
          "speechEnd": 23.16,
          "end": 23.16,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "800ce9f1039c5dd9fbf2027b1a79928d6531721ec06102466be1fbf06393d364",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.0,
          "providerTrimEnd": 9.25,
          "ink": "mA uA + mB uB = mA vA + mB vB"
        },
        {
          "id": "substitute",
          "text": "Substitute: two times four, plus three times negative one, equals two times negative two, plus three v B.",
          "start": 23.31,
          "speechEnd": 33.67,
          "end": 33.67,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "4b1c297b34b6f897526135191b361f695da0ea414544ff7515c863e67916b9dd",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.0,
          "providerTrimEnd": 10.36,
          "figures": [
            {
              "phrase": "two",
              "target": "A.mass",
              "value": "2"
            },
            {
              "phrase": "four",
              "target": "A.before",
              "value": "4"
            },
            {
              "phrase": "three",
              "target": "B.mass",
              "value": "3"
            },
            {
              "phrase": "one",
              "target": "B.before",
              "value": "1"
            },
            {
              "phrase": "two",
              "occurrence": 2,
              "target": "A.mass",
              "value": "2"
            },
            {
              "phrase": "two",
              "occurrence": 3,
              "target": "A.after",
              "value": "2"
            },
            {
              "phrase": "three",
              "occurrence": 2,
              "target": "B.mass",
              "value": "3"
            }
          ],
          "ink": "2×4 + 3×(−1) = 2×(−2) + 3vB"
        },
        {
          "id": "simplify",
          "text": "Eight minus three gives five on the left. A's final momentum is negative four, leaving three v B.",
          "hold": 2.0,
          "start": 33.82,
          "speechEnd": 43.08,
          "end": 45.08,
          "providerAudioSha256": "6367886659b5e8b487ce2fe5a056cabe7c4c61347869ef9a6b3faa4069a38d83",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.01,
          "providerTrimEnd": 9.27,
          "figures": [
            {
              "phrase": "three v B",
              "target": "B.mass",
              "value": "3"
            }
          ],
          "ink": "5 = −4 + 3vB"
        },
        {
          "id": "rearrange",
          "text": "Add four to both sides: nine equals three v B.",
          "hold": 2.0,
          "start": 45.23,
          "speechEnd": 48.81,
          "end": 50.81,
          "providerAudioSha256": "e918a2df77ccc6cfc8f1eaa89d3de14ae6fcd3f2f2bc6acd926203ffb032e537",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.0,
          "providerTrimEnd": 3.58,
          "figures": [
            {
              "phrase": "three v B",
              "target": "B.mass",
              "value": "3"
            }
          ],
          "ink": "9 = 3vB"
        },
        {
          "id": "result",
          "text": "Divide by three. B's velocity is positive three metres per second: a speed of three, to the right.",
          "hold": 2.0,
          "start": 50.96,
          "speechEnd": 61.24,
          "end": 63.24,
          "providerAudioSha256": "185454403a9bde0183eb175c79c592fe152e8bed27d9e3d9253f924ec22cf412",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.0,
          "providerTrimEnd": 10.28,
          "extraCues": [
            {
              "id": "result-value",
              "phrase": "three metres"
            }
          ],
          "figures": [
            {
              "phrase": "three metres",
              "target": "B.after",
              "value": "3"
            },
            {
              "phrase": "three to",
              "target": "B.after",
              "value": "3"
            },
            {
              "phrase": "three",
              "occurrence": 1,
              "target": "B.mass",
              "value": "3"
            }
          ],
          "ink": "vB = 9/3 = +3 m/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "interpret",
          "text": "The positive answer confirms our assumed arrow. A moves left, B moves right, and the particles separate.",
          "start": 63.39,
          "speechEnd": 72.78,
          "end": 72.78,
          "hold": 0.0,
          "providerAudioSha256": "22990ff7e2c2d83fe326970d6e9fb05842ff98839b5e19fe5f436e6994f7c716",
          "providerTrimStart": 0.05,
          "providerTrimEnd": 9.44
        }
      ],
