          "providerTrimStart": 0.0,
          "providerTrimEnd": 10.47,
          "caption": "Does reversal break total momentum conservation?"
        },
        {
          "id": "answer",
          "text": "No. The individual momentum changes are opposite; the pair's total remains conserved.",
          "start": 23.93,
          "speechEnd": 30.62,
